rd allocation and actual cash proceeds are distinct. Earlier-history and source-specific limitations remain explicit."},{"company_slug":"dbox","round_key":"eu-export-grant-2026","stage":"EU export-market development grant","amount":89738,"currency":"EUR","announced_date":null,"financing_type":"grant","record_kind":"round","amount_basis":"announced_round_size","closing_status":"announced","amount_qualifier":"exact","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://dbox.lt/eu-export.html","title":"DBOX / UAB IT logika original EU export-market development grant","published_date":null,"source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[{"slug":"european-union","name":"European Union","entity_type":"Government agency","role":"grantor","source_index":0,"id":"b1c6839d-4f1e-42ea-9632-328bec498312"}],"note_en":"Original names UAB IT logika as project implementer and own funding amount EUR89738, distinct from EUR179475 project budget. Project2026-03-03 through2027-03-03; commencement not public announcement or proof paid. Exact funding instrument within EU programme not further specified.","coverage_note_en":"Verified public-source subset only; original currencies and issuer boundaries retained. Facility capacity, award allocation and actual cash proceeds are distinct. Earlier-history and source-specific limitations remain explicit."},{"company_slug":"dbox","round_key":"eu-5g-project-allocation-disclosure","stage":"EU NextGenerationEU 5G project funding disclosure","amount":null,"currency":null,"announced_date":null,"financing_type":"grant","record_kind":"investment_disclosure","amount_basis":"undisclosed","closing_status":"announced","amount_qualifier":"exact","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://dbox.lt/eu-5g-sandbox.html","title":"DBOX / UAB IT logika original EU NextGenerationEU 5G project funding disclosure","published_date":null,"source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[{"slug":"european-union","name":"European Union","entity_type":"Government agency","role":"grantor","source_index":0,"id":"b1c6839d-4f1e-42ea-9632-328bec498312"}],"note_en":"UAB IT logika is applicant and project implementer, partners Pixpro, VilniusUniversity and TaikomasisDirbtinisIntelektas. Consortium funding EUR2897286.55 and budgetEUR5160157.24 are excluded from own amount, which remains undisclosed. Project2024-01 through2026-03 does not establish publicannouncement or cash paid.","coverage_note_en":"Verified public-source subset only; original currencies and issuer boundaries retained. Facility capacity, award allocation and actual cash proceeds are distinct. Earlier-history and source-specific limitations remain explicit."},{"company_slug":"de-havilland-canada","round_key":"canada-edc-production-financing-agreement-2026","stage":"Canada/EDC production financing agreement","financing_type":"undisclosed","announced_date":"2026-10-30","amount":2500000000,"currency":"CAD","amount_basis":"announced_round_size","closing_status":"signed","record_kind":"investment_disclosure","amount_qualifier":"up_to","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://dehavilland.com/production/de-havilland-canada-announces-agreement-and-de-havilland-canadair-515-production-increase/","title":"De Havilland Canada announces financing agreement and DHC-515 production increase","published_date":"2026-10-30","source_type":"company_announcement","disposition":""},{"url":"https://www.budget.canada.ca/2026/report-rapport/chap5-en.html","title":"Budget2026: financing to De Havilland Canada through EDC","published_date":null,"source_type":"investor_announcement","disposition":""}],"investors":[{"slug":"government-of-canada","name":"Government of Canada","entity_type":"Government agency","role":"undisclosed","source_index":0,"id":"2ea8f68f-7de0-4302-8bb4-b53094634fd1"},{"slug":"export-development-canada","name":"Export Development Canada","entity_type":"Government agency","role":"undisclosed","source_index":0,"id":"086c6879-c612-4383-9ee2-8dddc6a51b03"}],"note_en":"Actual issuer De Havilland Aircraft of Canada Limited announced an agreement with Canada and Export Development Canada for up to CAD2.5bn of financing. Canadian federal Budget2026 corroborates the own company ceiling and EDC delivery. This is a commitment ceiling, not CAD2.5bn paid, a procurement order, or a completed grant/equity round. Issuer anticipates transaction completion in Q12027. Original issuer/budget pages do not allocate instruments or lender shares; instrument and participant roles remain undisclosed rather than infer fully drawn loans or individual cheques. Later media describes loans and guarantees, which must not be summed as paid proceeds.","coverage_note_en":"Verified bounded public-source subset through 2026-11-15. Issuer, instrument, dates and amount limitations are explicit; no complete history or cumulative funding claim."},{"company_slug":"dedienne-aerospace","round_key":"france-relance-digital-transformation-support-2020-2022","stage":"France Relance digital transformation support disclosure","financing_type":"grant","announced_date":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":"undisclosed","closing_status":"announced","record_kind":"investment_disclosure","amount_qualifier":"exact","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://dedienne-aero.com/values/","title":"Dedienne Aerospace: France Relance subventions for2020–2022","published_date":null,"source_type":"company_announcement","disposition":""}],"investors":[{"slug":"france-relance","name":"France Relance","entity_type":"Government programme","role":"grantor","source_index":0,"id":"36f99402-1dfe-4ec4-91a8-aceb29955e3a"}],"note_en":"Dedienne Aerospace states it benefited from France Relance subventions during2020–2022 for digital transformation of its French locations. This records one bounded historical support disclosure, not a fabricated single dated cheque or an aggregate amount. Exact grant agreements, project allocations, public announcement date and cash-disbursement schedule are not disclosed; amount/currency/date remain null. Distinct from the existing ADEME PACTE Industrie award.","coverage_note_en":"Verified bounded public-source subset through 2026-11-15. Issuer, instrument, dates and amount limitations are explicit; no complete history or cumulative funding claim."},{"company_slug":"defcomm","round_key":"fincantieri-capital-increase-agreement-2026","stage":"Fincantieri primary equity investment agreement","financing_type":"equity","announced_date":"2026-07-06","amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":"undisclosed","closing_status":"signed","record_kind":"investment_disclosure","amount_qualifier":"exact","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://www.fincantieri.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/2026/fincantieri-creates-an-international-underwater-champion-acquisition-of-four-companies-to-accelerate-growth-in-marine-drone-and-in-commercial-and-defense-underwater-activities-with-an-initial-expenditur-of-approzimately-euro-600-million","title":"Fincantieri: Defcomm binding agreement including capital increase","published_date":"2026-07-06","source_type":"investor_announcement","disposition":""}],"investors":[{"slug":"fincantieri","name":"Fincantieri S.p.A.","entity_type":"Corporate investor","role":"participant","source_index":0,"id":"05f8cf97-10f6-4133-a9b6-7f1725d9796b"}],"note_en":"Fincantieri signed a binding agreement with sole shareholder Fedcomm Holding Italia S.r.l. to acquire an initial49% of Italian Defcomm via a capital increase plus direct purchase of existing shares. Only the explicitly stated primary equity commitment is represented; primary amount is undisclosed. Secondary seller consideration, four-company EUR600m aggregate, Fincantieri own ABB proceeds and future2%/49% options are excluded. Closing is not established; signed agreement does not imply paid company proceeds. Cohort source article distinguishes this Italian issuer from FrenchExail; stored company geography remains unchanged.","coverage_note_en":"Verified bounded public-source subset through 2026-11-15. Issuer, instrument, dates and amount limitations are explicit; no complete history or cumulative funding claim."}],"relationships":[]}'::jsonb; matched integer; begin
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research(research_id,slug,name,entity_type,evidence_status,evidence_status_label,evidence_basis,source_dataset,source_dataset_version,publication_status,map_ready,verified_as_of,approved_at,missing_fields) select distinct 'funding-research:'||(p->>'slug'),p->>'slug',p->>'name',p->>'entity_type','deal','Source-confirmed financing participant','primary_or_transaction_party',(select data->>'dataset' from input),(select data->>'checked_at' from input),'approved',false,(r->>'checked_at')::date,now(),array['Published offices','Fund size / manager AUM','Typical ticket size','Investment mandate'] from participants on conflict(slug) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research(research_id,slug,name,entity_type,evidence_status,evidence_status_label,evidence_basis,source_dataset,source_dataset_version,publication_status,map_ready,verified_as_of,approved_at,missing_fields) select 'funding-research:'||(g->'investor'->>'slug'),g->'investor'->>'slug',g->'investor'->>'name',g->'investor'->>'entity_type','deal','Company-confirmed investor listing','company_published_investors',(select data->>'dataset' from input),(select data->>'checked_at' from input),'approved',false,(select(data->>'checked_at')::date from input),now(),array['Published offices','Round attribution','Individual contribution'] from generic on conflict(slug) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_rounds(company_id,round_key,stage,financing_type,announced_date,amount,currency,amount_basis,closing_status,note_en,publication_status,checked_at,record_kind,parent_round_id,amount_qualifier) select c.id,r->>'round_key',r->>'stage',r->>'financing_type',r->>'announced_date',(r->>'amount')::numeric,r->>'currency',r->>'amount_basis',r->>'closing_status',r->>'note_en','approved',(r->>'checked_at')::date,coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round'),null::uuid,coalesce(r->>'amount_qualifier','exact') from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug'  where coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round')<>'extension' on conflict(company_id,round_key) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_rounds(company_id,round_key,stage,financing_type,announced_date,amount,currency,amount_basis,closing_status,note_en,publication_status,checked_at,record_kind,parent_round_id,amount_qualifier) select c.id,r->>'round_key',r->>'stage',r->>'financing_type',r->>'announced_date',(r->>'amount')::numeric,r->>'currency',r->>'amount_basis',r->>'closing_status',r->>'note_en','approved',(r->>'checked_at')::date,coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round'),parent.id,coalesce(r->>'amount_qualifier','exact') from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds parent on parent.company_id=c.id and parent.round_key=r->>'parent_round_key' where coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round')='extension' on conflict(company_id,round_key) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_round_sources(round_id,url,title,source_type,checked_at) select f.id,s->>'url',s->>'title',s->>'source_type',(r->>'checked_at')::date from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key' cross join lateral jsonb_array_elements(r->'sources') s on conflict(round_id,url) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_round_investors(round_id,investor_research_id,role,source_url,checked_at,contribution_amount,contribution_currency) select f.id,i.id,p->>'role',r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'url',(r->>'checked_at')::date,(p->'contribution'->>'amount')::numeric,p->'contribution'->>'currency' from participants join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key' join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=p->>'slug' on conflict(round_id,investor_research_id) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research_sources(investor_id,url,title,accessed_at) select distinct i.id,r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'url',r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'title',(r->>'checked_at')::date from participants join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=p->>'slug' where not exists(select 1 from public.investor_research_sources ex where ex.investor_id=i.id and ex.url=r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'url' and ex.location_id is null) on conflict do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_companies(investor_research_id,company_id,relationship_type,evidence_status,source_url,reviewed_at,portfolio_name_as_published,match_method,match_note_en) select i.id,c.id,'portfolio_listed','company_published_investors',g->'source'->>'url',(select(data->>'checked_at')::date from input),c.name,'manual',g->>'note_en' from generic join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=g->'investor'->>'slug' join public.companies c on c.slug::text=g->>'company_slug' on conflict(investor_research_id,company_id,relationship_type) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research_sources(investor_id,url,title,accessed_at) select distinct i.id,g->'source'->>'url',g->'source'->>'title',(select(data->>'checked_at')::date from input) from generic join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=g->'investor'->>'slug' where not exists(select 1 from public.investor_research_sources ex where ex.investor_id=i.id and ex.url=g->'source'->>'url' and ex.location_id is null) on conflict do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_investment_research(company_id,coverage_status,coverage_note_en,checked_at,source_urls) select c.id,'partial',min(r->>'coverage_note_en'),max((r->>'checked_at')::date),array_agg(distinct s->>'url') from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' cross join lateral jsonb_array_elements(r->'sources') s group by c.id on conflict(company_id) do update set coverage_note_en=excluded.coverage_note_en,checked_at=excluded.checked_at,source_urls=(select array_agg(distinct u order by u) from unnest(company_investment_research.source_urls||excluded.source_urls) u),updated_at=now() where company_investment_research.coverage_status='partial' and (select data->>'dataset' from input)<>'company-funding-pilot-v1';
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) select count(*) into matched from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key'; if matched<>22 then raise exception 'Manifest events did not all resolve';end if; if exists(with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) select 1 from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key' where row(f.stage,f.financing_type,f.announced_date,f.amount,f.currency::text,f.amount_basis,f.closing_status,f.record_kind,f.amount_qualifier) is distinct from row(r->>'stage',r->>'financing_type',r->>'announced_date',(r->>'amount')::numeric,r->>'currency',r->>'amount_basis',r->>'closing_status',coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round'),coalesce(r->>'amount_qualifier','exact'))) then raise exception 'Manifest conflicts with stored event: review instead of overwriting';end if;end $funding_import$;